omaxian-voxtype (1.1.1-3) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Fix: Super+Ctrl+V never started the daemon: "voxtype daemon --clipboard"
    is rejected by voxtype 1.1.1 ("unexpected argument"); the options must
    come before the subcommand. Now "voxtype -q --no-hotkey --clipboard
    daemon": the built-in evdev hotkey stays off now that users are in the
    "input" group (i3 owns the key).
  * README: ydotool is shipped (omaxian-ydotool).

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:10:00 +0100

omaxian-voxtype (1.1.1-2) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Wrapper: refuse cleanly (exit 132, message) on CPUs without x86-64-v2
    instead of letting the upstream baseline binary die with SIGILL.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:16:46 +0100

omaxian-voxtype (1.1.1-1) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: CPU-adaptive /usr/bin/voxtype (diverts the upstream
    wrapper), sysvinit-friendly daemon start + record toggle, X11 clipboard
    output via xclip, i3 keybinding Super+Ctrl+V seeded once per user.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:10:00 +0100
